## C. Specialist dealers & auction houses — typical purchase path (private treaty or upcoming auction)

These organizations routinely transact in Stradivari-class instruments; **inventory is not always public**; buyability is usually “contact the firm.”

| Organization | Role | URL |
|--------------|------|-----|
| J & A Beare | Leading London / international dealer; notable sales pages | https://www.beares.com/ |
| Ingles & Hayday | Auction house + dealership; private sales | https://ingleshayday.com/private-sales/ |
| Tarisio | Specialist auctioneer; Cozio archive; scheduled sales calendar | https://tarisio.com/ |
| Ingles & Hayday notable Strad sales index (examples) | https://ingleshayday.com/notable-sales-instrument/a-violin-by-antonio-stradivari-18/ |

