## G. How to extend this file

1. Check Tarisio, Ingles & Hayday, Beares, Christie’s, Sotheby’s, Bonhams “fine musical instruments” for **current** PDF catalogues.  
2. Distinguish **sold** lot pages from **upcoming** auctions (many URLs persist after the sale).  
3. For any instrument priced under ~USD 50k claiming to be an authentic Stradivari, assume misdescription or fraud until independently certified.

**End of snapshot.**
